  </div> <div class="c-brave-hero"> <div class="hero-mesh-brave"> <div data-poster-url="/assets/60ba65c80d688d74edd614a6_Comp-2-v3-poster-00001.jpg" data-video-urls="/assets/60ba65c80d688d74edd614a6_Comp-2-v3-transcode.mp4,/assets/60ba65c80d688d74edd614a6_Comp-2-v3-transcode.webm" data-autoplay="true" data-loop="true" data-wf-ignore="true" data-beta-bgvideo-upgrade="false" class="mesh-vid w-background-video w-background-video-atom"><video id="ae54b7ae-77e3-aa5f-e012-777ea28a5850-video" autoplay="" loop="" style="background-image:url(/lp/brave&quot;/assets/60ba65c80d688d74edd614a6_Comp-2-v3-poster-00001.jpg&quot;)" muted="" playsinline="" data-wf-ignore="true" data-object-fit="cover"> <source src="/assets/60ba65c80d688d74edd614a6_Comp-2-v3-transcode.mp4" data-wf-ignore="true"> <source src="/assets/60ba65c80d688d74edd614a6_Comp-2-v3-transcode.webm" data-wf-ignore="true"> </video></div> </div> <div class="c-brave-hero-block"> <div class="container is-brave-hero"> <div class="div-block-116"><img src="/images/radix-logo_1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Radix Logo" class="radix-logo"></div> <div class="bm-hero"> <h1 class="title-hero-brave">Decentralizing Global Finance: The $400 Trillion Opportunity</h1> </div> <div class="bm-30"> <h4 class="is_light_hero_text shadow"><strong>Web 3 Fintech is inevitable. <br>The only question: how will it be powered?</strong></h4> </div> <h4 class="is_light_hero_text shadow">Radix is the only Layer-1 protocol intentionally designed to meet the needs of billions of users and trillions worth of assets.</h4> </div> </div> <div class="c-signup"> <div class="container is-zindex"> <div class="c-brave-signup-holder"> <div class="bm-20"> <h4><Fragment set:html={topHeadlineHtml} /></h4> </div> <div id="signup-3" class="ml-form w-embed"> <div class="ml-embedded" data-form={topFormId}></div> </div> <div class="privacy-policy"> <div>By clicking “Submit”, you agree to our <a href="/privacy-policy" target="_blank" class="privacy-link">Privacy policy</a>. We