    </div> <div> <div class="c-flex-inline brave"> <div class="t_button is_social-brave"><img src="/images/twitter.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Twitter" class="social_img brave"> <div> <a href="https://twitter.com/RadixDLT">{twitterFollowers}</a> </div> </div> <div class="t_button is_social-brave mid"><img src="/images/discord.svg" loading="lazy" alt="discord logo" class="social_img brave"> <div> <a href="https://discord.gg/WkB2USt">{discordFollowers}</a> </div> </div> <div class="t_button is_social-brave"><img src="/images/telegram.svg" loading="lazy" alt="telegram logo" class="social_img brave"> <div> <a href="https://t.me/radix_dlt">{telegramFollowers}</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="c-section is-no-bm"> <div class="container"> <div class="brave-title nbm"> <div class="bm-40"> <h2>DeFi can do everything finance does today, faster, cheaper, and more efficiently.</h2> </div> <div class="div-block-126"> <p>So why is DeFi so small today (only $200 billion) when the opportunity ($400 trillion) is so huge?</p> </div> <h3 class="t_gradient_blue">Because building DeFi today sucks</h3> </div> </div> </div> <div class="c-section cm-top-m"> <div class="container"> <div class="c-timeline v2"> <div class="c-timeline-section large-padding"> <div class="c-timeline-half left v2"> <div class="c-timeline-group v2"> <div class="c-timeline-top right"><img src="/images/building.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""></div> <div class="c-timeline-green bm-10">TradFi Today</div> <div class="c-t-heading"> <h4>Traditional <br>Finance</h4> </div> <div class="c-timeline-cont"> <p class="c-t-comp"><strong>Finance is slow.</strong> <br>It can take days to buy, sell, or trade assets.</p> </div> <p class="c-t-comp"><strong>Finance is inefficient.<br>‍</strong>Multiple intermediaries are involved in any non-cash transaction.</p> <p class="c-t-comp"><strong>Finance is unnecessarily expensive.<br>‍</strong>Remember all those intermediaries? They each take a cut.</p> </div> </div> <div class="c-timeline-half"> <div class="c-timeline-group v2"> <div class="c-timeline-top"><img src="/images/coin.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""></div> <div class="c-timeline-green bm-10">DeFi Today</div> <div class="c-t-heading"> <h4>Why Decentralized Finance (DeFi) Hasn’t Fixed It Yet</h4> </div> <div class="c-timeline-cont"> <p class="c-t-comp left"><strong>DeFi sucks for developers. </strong><br>Up to 90% of developer time is wasted battling code. And still there have been over $1bn of hacks and exploits in the last year alone.</p> </div> <p class="c-t-comp left"><strong>DeFi sucks for entrepreneurs. </strong><br>It can cost millions of dollars and years of work building a DeFi business.</p> <p class="c-t-comp left"><strong>DeFi sucks for users. <br></strong>Would you want to pay hundreds of dollars in fees or wait hours for a transaction to confirm?<br><br>Neither do millions of others.</p> </div> </div> <div class="c-timeline-dot-holder"> <div class="c-track-green end-large"> <div class="track-inner"></div> </div> <div class="c-timeline-dot last-dot"> <div class="c-timeline-single-dot last-one"></div> </div> <div class="div-block-119"> <div class="div-block-120"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="c-timeline-holder-mid"> <div class="c-track"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="c-section cm-top-m"> <div class="container"> <div class="brave-title"> <div class="bm-20"> <h2>How Radix Fixes DeFi</h2> </div> <h3 class="t_gradient_full">“The biggest innovation in crypto since smart contracts”</h3> </div> <div class="c-card"> <div id="w-node-_8ded26d1-68b4-5062-21f5-58f57ca68bde-{pageIdSuffix}" class="c-card-grid"> <div id="w-node-_8ded26d1-68b4-5062-21f5-58f57ca68bdf-{pageIdSuffix}" class="card-content"> <div class="bm-10"> <h3 class="t_gradient_blue">A Game Engine for DeFi</h3> </div> <p class="text-smaller">Introducing Radix Engine and Scrypto: an intuitive smart contract platform that gives developers an unfair advantage and has the essentials for finance built in.</p> </div> <div id="w-node-_8ded26d1-68b4-5062-21f5-58f57ca68be5-{pageIdSuffix}" class="card-img"><img src="/images/Scrypto-Icon-Round-1.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-29"></div> </div> </div> <div class="c-card"> <div id="w-node-c587d598-9c8a-970c-caac-048d36d4aab7-{pageIdSuffix}" class="c-card-grid"> <div id="w-node-c587d598-9c8a-970c-caac-048d36d4aabe-{pageIdSuffix}" class="card-img"><img src="/images/card-2.webp" loading="lazy" alt=""></div> <div id="w-node-c587d598-9c8a-970c-caac-048d36d4aab8-{pageIdSuffix}" class="card-content right"> <div class="bm-10"> <h3 class="t_gradient_blue">Supercharging DeFi Ecosystem Growth</h3> </div> <p class="text-smaller">Blueprints, royalties, and services in a thriving marketplace of DeFi dApps where developers will be able to rapidly innovate, share, and earn, accelerating the path from idea to revenue.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="c-card"> <div id="w-node-_274b7b3e-6e1e-89bd-9931-79e5a5340d0c-{pageIdSuffix}" class="c-card-grid"> <div id="w-node-_988741a9-84c9-34ad-6240-7b37525920af-{pageIdSuffix}" class="card-content"> <div class="bm-10"> <h3 class="t_gradient_blue">Unlimited Scalability, Forever</h3> </div> <p class="text-smaller">Cerberus Consensus keeps transactions fees low forever, enables unlimited scalability through unlimited parallelism, while ensuring any number of dApps can work together instantly, always.</p> </div> <div id="w-node-_10aa4a6b-aa5d-4153-6c7c-2a2982e772e7-{pageIdSuffix}" class="card-img"><img src="/images/card-1.svg" loading="lazy" width="156" alt="" class="image-26"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="c-section"> <div class="container"> <div class="div-block-115"> <div id="w-node-_8b962729-fad1-b8df-23ca-ad2c567d4320-567d431d" class="c-numbers"><img src="/images/Reward-Rate.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="c-numbers-img"> <div class="c-numbers-content"> <h3 class="black">10.85%</h3> <p class="sub-tag-small">Reward Rate</p> </div> </div> <div id="w-node-_8b962729-fad1-b8df-23c