/div> </div> <div class="faq-content"> <div class="faq-el-holder"> <div class="faq-el-title"> <h4>What is Radix?</h4> <div class="faq-icon"> <div class="line_vert"></div> <div class="line_horiz"></div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-el-content"> <div class="faq-el-inner"> <div>Radix is the first decentralized network designed for the needs of DeFi (Decentralized Finance) at the scale of global finance. Radix offers developers a platform to confidently launch mainstream-ready dApps with unlimited scalability.</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-el-holder"> <div class="faq-el-title"> <h4>Where can I buy?</h4> <div class="faq-icon"> <div class="line_vert"></div> <div class="line_horiz"></div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-el-content"> <div class="faq-el-inner"> <div>XRD is Radix’s native token. You can purchase XRD on the <a href="https://trading.bitfinex.com/t/XRD:USD" target="_blank">Bitfinex</a> exchange. eXRD is the wrapped ERC-20 version of XRD, issued on the Ethereum network. eXRD is listed on <a href="https://trade.kucoin.com/EXRD-USDT" target="_blank">Kucoin</a> , <a href="https://www.gate.io/en/trade/EXRD_USDT" target="_blank">Gate.io</a> , <a href="https://app.uniswap.org/#/swap?inputCurrency=0x6468e79A80C0eaB0F9A2B574c8d5bC374Af59414&amp;outputCurrency=0xa0b86991c6218b36c1d19d4a2e9eb0ce3606eb48" target="_blank">Uniswap</a> , and other exchanges. eXRD can be exchanged 1:1 with XRD.</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>
